        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nWhat is the value of [MATH: (\u2212 (5)/(8)) \u00f7 (\u2212 (3)/(4))?]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: \u2212 (2)/(3)]\nb. [MATH: (2)/(3)]\nc. [MATH: 2]\nd. [MATH: \u2212 (5)/(6)]\ne. [MATH: (5)/(6)]"
